{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2020-12-23 13:31:00', 'title': 'RTX DEC. 29 DEADLINE: ZHANG INVESTOR LAW REMINDS INVESTORS WITH LOSSES OF THE DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION – RTX', 'text': 'NEW YORK, DEC. 23, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ZHANG INVESTOR LAW ANNOUNCES A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS WHO BOUGHT SHARES OF RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION F/K/A RAYTHEON COMPANY (NYSE: RTX, RTN) BETWEEN FEBRUARY 10, 2016 AND OCTOBER 27, 2020, INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS ALREADY BEEN FILED. IF YOU WISH TO SERVE AS LEAD PLAINTIFF, YOU MUST MOVE THE COURT NO LATER THAN DECEMBER 29, 2020.'}